{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "train-schedules-api-collection",
        "name": "Train Schedules API - Sri Lanka Railways",
        "description": "Complete API collection for querying Sri Lanka train schedules from the GraphCeylon Knowledge Graph Service.\n\n## Dataset Info\n- **Total Schedules**: 1,772\n- **Train Types**: Express, Semi Express, Slow\n- **Primary Hub**: Colombo Fort\n- **Date Range**: 2026-01-09\n\n## Important\n⚠️ **schedule_date is REQUIRED** for all schedule queries!\n\n## Quick Start\n1. Set the `base_url` variable to your server URL\n2. Initialize stations first: POST /railway/stations/initialize\n3. Initialize schedules: POST /railway/schedules/initialize\n4. Query schedules using the endpoints below",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "base_url",
            "value": "http://localhost:8000",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "schedule_date",
            "value": "2026-01-09",
            "type": "string"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "📊 Statistics & Overview",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get Schedule Statistics",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/railway/schedules/statistics",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "railway",
                                "schedules",
                                "statistics"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Get overview statistics including total schedules, train types breakdown, unique trains, and date range."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get Station Statistics",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/railway/stations/statistics",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "railway",
                                "stations",
                                "statistics"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Get railway station statistics by province and district."
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "🚂 Query Schedules",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get Schedules for Date",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/railway/schedules?schedule_date={{schedule_date}}&limit=50",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "railway",
                                "schedules"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "schedule_date",
                                    "value": "{{schedule_date}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "limit",
                                    "value": "50"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Get all schedules for the specified date. schedule_date is REQUIRED."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get Express Trains",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/railway/schedules?schedule_date={{schedule_date}}&train_type=Express&limit=20",
                            "host": [
